OL,3,GNEWSARefugee sanctuary plan is
OL,4,A'grandstanding', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has described a council's plan to
OL,7,Fcreate a county of sanctuary for
OL,8,Frefugees as a "grandstanding gesture".
OL,10,FLewis Cocking, the Conservative member
OL,11,Ffor Broxbourne, accused the Liberal
OL,12,FDemocrat-led Hertfordshire County
OL,13,FCouncil of putting forward an
OL,14,F"out-of-touch, ideological initiative".
OL,16,FSigning up to the scheme would make the
OL,17,Fcouncil part of a network of
OL,18,Forganisations offering a supportive
OL,19,Fculture for refugees and asylum
OL,20,Fseekers.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
